<title>GERMANY: Didier 96 gp pretax profit up 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Didier 96 gp pretax profit up 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     23	vs 21</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,289   vs 1,385</p>
<p>    Group workforce (headcount)	    5,144   vs 5,597</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German maker of blast furnace linings and hot blast stoves is Didier-Werke AG, 51 percent-owned by Austria's Radex-Heraklith Industriebeteiligungs AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
